# Allow-list. Only notebooks, the small helper package, settings and documentation are tracked.
# The supplied competition data, everything derived from it at ball level, the Cricsheet downloads,
# model files, player photos and team branding must never be committed.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/requirements.txt
!/config.yaml
!/notebooks/
!/rrlib/
!/docs/

**/.ipynb_checkpoints/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.parquet
*.zip
*.joblib
*.pkl
